SUMMARY:Chicago Comedy Club LIVE at Foundation Room at House of Blues Chicago
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nChicago Comedy Club LIVE at Foundation Room at House of Blues Chicago\nChicago Comedy Club brings its signature blend of stand-up comedy to the intimate and upscale Foundation Room at House of Blues Chicago. This weekly comedy showcase features top local and touring comedians in one of Chicago’s most unique venues. \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, July 23\, 2026\nDoors: 6:00 PM | Show: 7:30 PM\nVenue: Foundation Room at House of Blues Chicago\nAddress: 329 N Dearborn St\, Chicago\, IL 60654\nAge Requirement: 21+ (Valid ID required)\nSeating: Standing Room Only / General Admission\nParking: Valet parking available at Marina City complex \nAbout Chicago Comedy Club\nChicago Comedy Club is a premier comedy showcase that brings together the best stand-up comedians performing in Chicago. Known for its high-energy shows and top-tier talent\, the club has become a staple of Chicago’s vibrant comedy scene. Every performance features a rotating lineup of hilarious performers guaranteed to keep you laughing all night. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy stand-up comedy from top performers\nIntimate VIP-style setting in the Foundation Room\nFull bar service with a 2-item minimum purchase\nDoors open at 6PM\, show begins at 7:30PM\n21+ event — valid photo ID required\nStanding room only venue with great sightlines\n\nVenue Information\nThe Foundation Room at House of Blues Chicago is an exclusive\, members-style lounge located at 329 N Dearborn St in the heart of Chicago. This intimate venue offers a luxurious atmosphere with full bar service\, making it the perfect setting for an unforgettable comedy night. \nTicket Information\nTickets are available now through Ticketmaster. There is an 8-ticket limit per order. Resale tickets may also be available through VividSeats. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you.\nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/chicago-comedy-club-live-at-foundation-room-at-house-of-blues-chicago/
LOCATION:Foundation Room at House of Blues Chicago\, 329 N Dearborn St\, Chicago\, IL\, 60654\, USA
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://s1.ticketm.net/dam/a/a52/caff524e-ffb2-4438-89b4-b2fd7af24a52_TABLET_LANDSCAPE_LARGE_16_9.jpg
GEO:41.8882351;-87.6291025
