SUMMARY:Mario Adrion LIVE at Punch Line Irving
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nMario Adrion LIVE at Punch Line Irving\nGet ready for a night of sharp\, internationally-flavored comedy as Mario Adrion takes the stage at Punch Line Irving! The German-American comedian and social media sensation brings his unique perspective on life\, culture\, and the American experience to Irving\, Texas on July 23\, 2026. Don’t miss this rising star of stand-up comedy! \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, July 23\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM (Doors open at 6:00 PM)\nVenue: Punch Line Irving\nAddress: 310 W Las Colinas Blvd.\, Suite 130\, Irving\, TX 75039\nAge Requirement: 18+ with valid government-issued photo ID\nBeverage Minimum: 2 beverages per person \nAbout Mario Adrion\nMario Adrion is a German-American comedian\, actor\, and social media personality who has amassed millions of followers with his hilarious takes on cultural differences between Europe and America. Known for his sharp wit and relatable storytelling\, Mario has performed sold-out shows across the US and Europe\, bringing his unique cross-cultural comedy to audiences worldwide. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHilarious cross-cultural comedy from a social media sensation\nSharp observations on American vs. European life\nAn intimate comedy club experience at Punch Line Irving\nEngaging storytelling and crowd interaction\nFull bar service with a 2-drink minimum\n\nVenue Information\nPunch Line Irving is located in the heart of Las Colinas at 310 W Las Colinas Blvd.\, Suite 130\, Irving\, TX. This premier comedy club offers an intimate atmosphere with full bar service\, making it the perfect spot for a night out in the Dallas-Fort Worth area. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at approximately $32 and are available now. This is an 18+ event with a 2-beverage minimum per person. Secure your seats today! \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/mario-adrion-live-at-punch-line-irving/
LOCATION:Punch Line Irving\, 310 W Las Colinas Blvd.\, Suite 130\, Irving\, TX\, 75039\, United States Of America
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://comedycalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/14213aad-e449-4c6d-8297-b838075b8943_TABLET_LANDSCAPE_LARGE_16_9-0knzhH.jpg
GEO:32.8734455;-96.9445654
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Punch Line Irving 310 W Las Colinas Blvd. Suite 130 Irving TX 75039 United States Of America;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=310 W Las Colinas Blvd.\, Suite 130:geo:-96.9445654,32.8734455
