SUMMARY:Andrew Schulz LIVE at Brea Improv
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAndrew Schulz\, one of the most fearless voices in modern stand-up comedy\, brings his unfiltered style to the Brea Improv for an intimate club performance on July 23\, 2026. \nHis Netflix special LIFE spent 15 consecutive days in the U.S. Top 10 and appeared in the Top 10 across 13 countries. He has sold out Madison Square Garden twice and headlined arenas across North America. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Thursday\, July 23\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM PDT\nVenue: Brea Improv\nAddress: 180 S Brea Blvd\, Brea\, CA 92821\nAge Requirement: 21+\nTickets From: $54\n\nAbout Andrew Schulz\nAndrew Schulz is a New York-native comedian whose Netflix special LIFE became a global hit in 2025. His podcast Flagrant has crossed 1.4 billion total views on YouTube. Known for bold\, unfiltered comedy covering politics\, pop culture\, and everything in between. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/andrew-schulz-live-at-brea-improv-july-23/
