SUMMARY:Tommy Brennan LIVE at Punch Line Comedy Club San Francisco
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nTommy Brennan is a rising force in stand-up comedy\, known for his sharp\, self-aware humor and his ability to find comedy in the most relatable corners of everyday life. His style blends clever wordplay with honest\, personal storytelling — the kind of comedy that makes you laugh and nod at the same time. \nA regular on the national club circuit\, Tommy Brennan has been building a devoted fanbase through relentless touring and a string of standout performances at some of the country’s top comedy venues. His material is consistently fresh\, well-crafted\, and delivered with a natural confidence that makes him a joy to watch. \nWhether you’re a longtime fan or discovering him for the first time\, Tommy Brennan’s run at Punch Line Comedy Club is not to be missed. Multiple shows across the weekend give you plenty of chances to catch this rising star live. \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, July 23\, 2026 (also Fri July 24 & Sat July 25)\nTime: 8:00 PM PDT (Thu) | 7:30 PM & 9:45 PM (Fri) | 7:00 PM & 9:15 PM (Sat)\nVenue: Punch Line Comedy Club – San Francisco\, 444 Battery Street\, San Francisco\, CA 94111\nAge Restriction: 18+ / 2 Beverage Minimum\nTicket Price Range: $29 – $51 \nAbout the Venue\nPunch Line Comedy Club – San Francisco is one of the most storied comedy venues in the United States\, located at 444 Battery Street in San Francisco’s Financial District. Since 1978\, Punch Line has been the launching pad for comedy legends including Robin Williams\, Ellen DeGeneres\, Dana Carvey\, and countless others. \nThe club seats approximately 300 guests in an intimate table-and-chair setup that puts every audience member close to the action. A full bar and food menu are available throughout the show\, and the attentive staff ensures a seamless\, enjoyable experience from start to finish. \nConveniently located near BART and Muni stops\, Punch Line is easy to reach by public transit. Parking is available in nearby garages throughout the Financial District. It’s the perfect venue for a memorable night of comedy in the heart of San Francisco. \nWhat to Expect\nTommy Brennan performs five shows across the weekend of July 23–25\, giving fans multiple opportunities to experience his comedy live. Each show is a full stand-up set — tight\, funny\, and packed with the kind of material that earns him new fans every night. \nThe 18+ age restriction and 2-beverage minimum are in effect for all shows. Doors open approximately 30–45 minutes before showtime. Arrive early to grab a great seat and settle in with a drink before the laughs begin. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $29 – $51 (before taxes and fees)\nTickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale). \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/tommy-brennan-live-at-punch-line-comedy-club-san-francisco/
