DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets (Ticketmaster) \nResale Tickets (VividSeats) \nJay Mohr LIVE at Brea Improv\nActor\, comedian\, and sports radio host Jay Mohr brings his stand-up comedy to the Brea Improv for a multi-night run in July 2026. \nBest known for his roles in Jerry Maguire\, Action\, and as a former cast member of Saturday Night Live\, Jay Mohr is also a seasoned stand-up comedian with a sharp\, quick wit. \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, July 23\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM PDT (Doors open at 6:30 PM)\nVenue: Brea Improv\nAddress: 180 S Brea Blvd\, Brea\, CA 92821\nAge Requirement: 21+\nSeating: General Admission\, first-come first-served\nNote: Two-item minimum purchase required \nAbout Jay Mohr\nJay Mohr is a comedian\, actor\, and sports radio host best known for his role in Jerry Maguire and as a former SNL cast member. He has hosted Fox Sports Radio’s Jay Mohr Sports and released multiple stand-up specials. His quick wit and storytelling ability make him a must-see live performer. \nWhat to Expect\n\nSharp\, quick-witted stand-up from a Hollywood veteran\nStories from his career in film\, TV\, and sports media\nIntimate club setting at the Brea Improv\n21+ show with full bar and two-item minimum\n\nVenue Information\nBrea Improv is located at 180 S Brea Blvd in Brea\, CA. Part of the legendary Improv comedy club chain in Orange County\, CA. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at $25 (plus fees). \nOfficial Tickets (Ticketmaster) \nResale Tickets (VividSeats) \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
