SUMMARY:Tammy Pescatelli LIVE at Jimmy Kimmel's Comedy Club
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nTammy Pescatelli is a sharp\, witty stand-up comedian who has built a devoted following through her honest\, relatable humor about family\, relationships\, and the everyday absurdities of life. \nShe gained national attention as a finalist on Last Comic Standing and has since appeared on The Tonight Show\, Comedy Central\, and numerous television specials\, establishing herself as one of the most consistent and entertaining voices in stand-up comedy. \nPescatelli’s comedy is smart\, self-aware\, and laugh-out-loud funny — blending personal storytelling with sharp observational humor that connects with audiences of all backgrounds. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Friday\, July 24\, 2026\nShow Time: 7:30 PM (doors open earlier)\nVenue: Jimmy Kimmel’s Comedy Club\, 3545 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, NV 89109\nAge Restriction: 18+ Event\nTicket Prices: From $51\n\nAbout the Venue\nJimmy Kimmel’s Comedy Club is one of the premier comedy destinations on the Las Vegas Strip\, located on the iconic LINQ Promenade at 3545 S Las Vegas Blvd. \nThe intimate venue seats approximately 300 guests and features a state-of-the-art sound system\, excellent sightlines from every seat\, and full bar service throughout the show. \nThe club’s cozy atmosphere creates an up-close-and-personal comedy experience unlike the large arena shows Vegas is known for. Parking is available at the LINQ Hotel parking garage\, and the venue is easily accessible via the Las Vegas Monorail. \nThe LINQ Promenade itself offers a variety of dining and entertainment options before and after the show\, making it a perfect evening destination on the Strip. \nWhat to Expect\nTammy Pescatelli delivers a headline solo stand-up performance packed with her signature blend of personal storytelling\, sharp wit\, and relatable humor. \nExpect a warm\, engaging show where Pescatelli’s natural comedic instincts and years of experience create an effortlessly entertaining evening. Her sets are known for their clever construction and ability to find humor in the most relatable everyday situations. \nThis is a perfect show for fans of smart\, accessible comedy in an intimate Las Vegas club setting. Arrive early to grab a drink and secure the best seats in the house. \nTicket Information\nTickets start from $51 and are available through official and resale channels. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/tammy-pescatelli-live-at-jimmy-kimmels-comedy-club/
LOCATION:Jimmy Kimmel’s Comedy Club\, 3545 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, NV\, 89109\, USA
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://comedycalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/00337dcc-5bd1-4b00-816c-491561ad4b46_CUSTOM-CifXm8.jpg
