SUMMARY:Adam Ray: WHO IS ME Tour LIVE at Hard Rock Live Orlando
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nAdam Ray is one of the most versatile and hilarious comedians in the game today. Best known for his uncanny Dr. Phil impression that went viral and led to a recurring role alongside Marshawn Lynch\, Adam has built a massive following through his stand-up comedy\, podcast\, and social media presence. \nHis podcast About Last Night is one of the most popular comedy podcasts in the country\, featuring candid conversations with fellow comedians\, athletes\, and celebrities. Adam has appeared on The Tonight Show\, Conan\, Comedy Central\, and has toured extensively across North America. \nAdam’s comedy style is high-energy\, character-driven\, and deeply funny — blending sharp observational humor with impressions\, storytelling\, and crowd work. His live shows are known for being unpredictable and wildly entertaining from start to finish. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, July 24\, 2026 \nTime: 8:00 PM – 9:30 PM \nVenue: Hard Rock Live Orlando\, 6050 Universal Blvd\, Orlando\, FL 32819 \nAge Restriction: Ages 18+ Only \nTicket Prices: $35 – $45 \nAbout the Venue\nHard Rock Live Orlando is Central Florida’s premier live entertainment destination\, situated at Universal CityWalk right next to Universal Orlando Resort. With a capacity of approximately 3\,000 guests\, the venue delivers an intimate yet electric atmosphere for comedy and concert events alike. \nThe venue features world-class acoustics\, a full bar and dining options\, and seating across multiple sections including center floor\, left\, right\, and balcony areas. Balcony tables offer a premium experience and can be reserved by calling the box office at (407) 351-5483. \nParking is conveniently available at Universal CityWalk’s parking garages. The surrounding area offers a wide variety of dining and entertainment options\, making it easy to turn the evening into a full night out in Orlando. \nWhat to Expect\nAdam Ray’s WHO IS ME Tour is a full-length stand-up comedy show featuring his signature blend of impressions\, character work\, and sharp observational humor. Expect a high-energy\, 90-minute performance that will have you laughing from the opening minute to the final bow. \nThis is an 18+ event\, so the material will be unfiltered and adult-oriented. Whether you know Adam from his Dr. Phil impression\, his podcast\, or his stand-up specials\, this show promises to be an unforgettable night of comedy in Orlando. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $35 – $45 (all-in pricing\, fees included before taxes) \nPurchase official tickets through Ticketmaster or find resale options through VividSeats. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/adam-ray-who-is-me-tour-live-at-hard-rock-live-orlando/
LOCATION:Hard Rock Live Orlando\, 6050 Universal Blvd\, Orlando\, FL\, 32819\, United States Of America
